@startuml usecases_aluno
!theme plain

title Módulo: Aluno (Core)

package "Aluno" {
  usecase "CreateAlunoUseCase" as create
  usecase "GetAlunoProfileUseCase" as profile
  usecase "GetAlunoHistoryUseCase" as history
}

actor Admin as admin
actor Professor as prof
actor Aluno as aluno

admin --> create
prof --> create
aluno --> profile
aluno --> history
prof --> profile
prof --> history

note right of create
  **Input:** nome, turmasIds
  **Output:** Aluno
  **Regras:**
  - Apenas Admin/Professor
  - Criar status_graduacao inicial
    (Branca, 0 graus, 0 aulas)
  - Definir is_ativo = true
end note

note right of profile
  **Input:** alunoId
  **Output:** Aluno (com status_graduacao)
  **Regras:**
  - Retornar dados completos
  - Incluir faixa e grau atual
  - Calcular progresso %
end note

note right of history
  **Input:** alunoId
  **Output:** List<HistoricoGraduacao>
  **Regras:**
  - Listar todas as graduações
  - Ordenar por data DESC
  - Incluir técnicas aprendidas
end note

@enduml
